  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extensions, by reason of their excessive scale, bulk, and poor detailed design, specifically the loss of the first-floor gap through the gable conversion, the overproliferation of front and rear dormers, and the inconsistent fenestration, would result in a cramped, overly dominant, and discordant form of development. The proposal fails to respect the original character of the host dwelling and would be detrimental to the visual amenities of the street scene, and would fail to preserve the setting of the adjacent Pine Walk Area of Special Local Character. As such, the proposal is contrary to Policies 28 and 30 of the Sutton Local Plan (2018) and the guidance set out in 'Design of Residential Extensions' SPD4."
  ],
